1
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,600
Bro Liu, have some tea.

2
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:56,679
Sister-in-law.

3
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:57,920
This is Bro.

4
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:59,399
Just call me Xiao Liu, okay?

5
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,679
I asked you to keep an eye on Li Wen.

6
00:01:05,719 --> 00:01:07,120
Notice anything unusual?

7
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:09,079
Nothing's up with him.

8
00:01:09,079 --> 00:01:10,000
Pretty normal.

9
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:21,200
Hello, Sir.

10
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:25,400
Can we start our business?

11
00:01:25,959 --> 00:01:26,760
Yes, we can.

12
00:01:27,079 --> 00:01:30,120
The list this time has over a thousand poor college students.

13
00:01:30,719 --> 00:01:32,560
They just received a Student grant.

14
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:33,959
You know what I mean, right?

15
00:01:35,079 --> 00:01:36,920
Poor college students?

16
00:01:37,359 --> 00:01:39,319
What, you don't have the heart for it?

17
00:01:41,319 --> 00:01:44,400
I'm worried there are too many poor college students...

18
00:01:44,599 --> 00:01:45,959
...for us to handle.

19
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:03,159
Didn't you want to write a novel?

20
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:05,079
I bought you some reference books,

21
00:02:05,079 --> 00:02:06,159
as well as mystery collections.

22
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,919
I don't know if they'll be of help.

23
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,599
She's Gu Ting.

24
00:02:14,199 --> 00:02:15,080
Not Yaoyao.

25
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,400
Li Wen.

26
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:18,080
Snap out of it.

27
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:26,199
Hurry up!

28
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,759
Whoever comes last gets a beating!

29
00:02:31,759 --> 00:02:32,599
Bro Snake.

30
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,520
Li Wen.

31
00:02:34,919 --> 00:02:36,000
Good job.

32
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:38,120
You fixed all our bugs,

33
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,840
and set up a new virtual platform.

34
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,360
I knew I picked the right guy.

35
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,759
Thanks for the praise, Bro Snake.

36
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,199
From now on,

37
00:02:44,199 --> 00:02:45,479
you're the Tech Team's

38
00:02:45,479 --> 00:02:46,199
leader.

39
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,560
Give him a hand!

40
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,840
Nice!

41
00:02:53,199 --> 00:02:54,080
Thanks, Bro Snake.

42
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,120
I'll definitely keep working hard.

43
00:02:55,199 --> 00:02:56,319
Forget about the future.

44
00:02:56,479 --> 00:02:58,599
I'm counting on you for something right now.

45
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:01,759
Look alive, everyone!

46
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,680
Our big deal is here.

47
00:03:04,159 --> 00:03:06,240
Over a thousand poor college students.

48
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,280
Whoever performs the best,

49
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,560
I'll reward you handsomely.

50
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,719
Awesome!

51
00:03:11,159 --> 00:03:12,080
Yeah!

52
00:03:12,719 --> 00:03:13,520
Get to work!

53
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:14,919
Yeah!

54
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,199
Let's go!

55
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:20,919
Li Wen,

56
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,879
the list of local college students,

57
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,759
I'm leaving it to you and Bro Liu.

58
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:26,719
Don't worry.

59
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:28,319
I have faith in you.

60
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,719
Don't worry, Bro.

61
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:31,680
Bro Liu.

62
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:33,520
Confiscate all their phones.

63
00:03:33,719 --> 00:03:34,879
During the operation,

64
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:36,479
no one is allowed to leave.

65
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,240
Counting on you.

66
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:42,960
Phones!

67
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,879
I need to find a way to notify Sun Ming.

68
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,080
Stand up!

69
00:03:58,919 --> 00:03:59,960
Hello, Student.

70
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,759
This is the Youth Reading Club.

71
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,360
We have a bonus for you.

72
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:05,120
Student, this is the school committee.

73
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,759
Calling about your tuition fees.

74
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:08,599
Student, this is the final deadline.

75
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:10,879
If you keep this up, I really can't help you.

76
00:04:14,319 --> 00:04:15,479
What the hell is going on?

77
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,920
So far,

78
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:18,720
you haven't closed a single deal!

79
00:04:24,439 --> 00:04:25,399
Help!

80
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,120
Spare me, Bro!

81
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:31,360
I'm sorry!

82
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,360
Should've thought of that sooner!

83
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,120
Get up!

84
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:51,920
Enough.

85
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:54,199
Lock him up.

86
00:05:01,399 --> 00:05:02,959
Whoever performs the worst tonight

87
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,120
will end up just like him.

88
00:05:05,519 --> 00:05:06,879
Old man,

89
00:05:06,879 --> 00:05:09,399
can you smoke a little less?

90
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:16,759
Here, Dad.

91
00:05:16,759 --> 00:05:17,519
Your medicine is ready.

92
00:05:18,319 --> 00:05:19,120
Dad,

93
00:05:19,759 --> 00:05:20,959
stop smoking.

94
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,240
Hurry up and drink it.

95
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:23,800
Smoke less.

96
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,480
He never listens to me.

97
00:05:28,399 --> 00:05:30,759
Shanshan, you're in college now.

98
00:05:30,879 --> 00:05:32,079
Your studies are important.

99
00:05:32,079 --> 00:05:33,360
Don't travel back and forth on weekends.

100
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,480
Mom can handle things.

101
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,439
Mom,

102
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:37,600
college is much more relaxed than high school.

103
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,800
I'm not tired at all.

104
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,360
Your mom and dad,

105
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,480
are useless.

106
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:43,079
We're holding you back.

107
00:05:44,079 --> 00:05:45,560
Mom, don't say that.

108
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:47,480
I can do work-study.

109
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:50,120
And the government gives out plenty of Student grants too.

110
00:05:50,399 --> 00:05:52,360
Going to college barely costs the family anything.

111
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,160
Thank heavens.

112
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,839
Our daughter is making us so proud.

113
00:06:07,879 --> 00:06:08,600
Hello, Student.

114
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,959
We are from the Municipal Education Bureau's Student Grant Office.

115
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,120
Is this Student Huang Shanshan?

116
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,839
Speaking.

117
00:06:14,839 --> 00:06:16,000
Education Bureau?

118
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,120
What's this about?

119
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,000
A few days ago,

120
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,519
didn't you apply for the New Youth Student grant?

121
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,720
I'm calling to inform you.

122
00:06:21,959 --> 00:06:22,720
Congratulations.

123
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:24,319
Your application has been approved.

124
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:27,759
But why didn't I get a notification?

125
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,360
Because the quota is limited,

126
00:06:29,399 --> 00:06:31,680
after our assessment,

127
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,519
for the students who need this money most,

128
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:34,879
we've opened a fast track.

129
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:35,920
We hope this money

130
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:38,759
can quickly help with your studies and daily life.

131
00:06:38,959 --> 00:06:41,360
We are notifying everyone individually and confidentially.

132
00:06:42,399 --> 00:06:43,360
I see.

133
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,279
Thank you.

134
00:06:44,279 --> 00:06:45,160
Thank you so much!

135
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,920
So, this money

136
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:50,079
can only be transferred through a bank ATM.

137
00:06:50,079 --> 00:06:50,879
Therefore, Student,

138
00:06:50,879 --> 00:06:52,279
you need to take your bank card

139
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:54,120
and go to the nearest bank to withdraw the money.

140
00:06:54,959 --> 00:06:57,079
Why can't it be sent directly to me?

141
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:59,720
Because there are many applicants,

142
00:06:59,879 --> 00:07:01,279
and we notified you relatively late.

143
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,959
Today is the last day.

144
00:07:03,199 --> 00:07:05,319
You must withdraw the money today.

145
00:07:05,519 --> 00:07:07,959
Otherwise, the quota will automatically pass to the next person.

146
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:09,160
The procedure is very complicated.

147
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:10,959
I'll go.

148
00:07:10,959 --> 00:07:11,720
I'll go right now.

149
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:12,399
I'm going right away.

150
00:07:12,399 --> 00:07:13,399
Please wait a moment.

151
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:15,079
Student, please hurry.

152
00:07:15,079 --> 00:07:16,360
Let me know when you arrive.

153
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,720
I'll do my best to assist you.

154
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,519
Okay, I'm heading out now.

155
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,399
Am I good or what?

156
00:07:25,399 --> 00:07:27,399
I closed a deal in just three calls.

157
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,920
I'm nowhere near as good as you, Bro Liu.

158
00:07:30,519 --> 00:07:31,240
Bro Liu,

159
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:32,800
please teach me more later.

160
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,519
You got it.

161
00:07:35,519 --> 00:07:36,360
Thanks, Bro Liu.

162
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,759
Shanshan, where are you going?

163
00:07:44,759 --> 00:07:45,560
I need to run an errand.

164
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,680
Don't worry about the cooking.

165
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:47,800
I'll cook when I get back!

166
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,720
Shanshan, what are you doing?

167
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,199
Why the rush?

168
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,519
Bro Long,

169
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:56,279
where are you going?

170
00:07:56,279 --> 00:07:57,519
I'm heading to the county town.

171
00:07:57,519 --> 00:07:58,519
Can you give me a ride?

172
00:07:58,519 --> 00:07:59,319
I need to go there too.

173
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:00,160
Sure, get on.

174
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,000
Thanks, Bro Long.

175
00:08:02,319 --> 00:08:03,079
Hold on tight!

176
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:03,639
Alright!

177
00:08:03,639 --> 00:08:04,160
Let's go.

178
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,519
Alright, everyone stop what you're doing.

179
00:08:10,519 --> 00:08:11,480
We received a tip-off

180
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:13,600
that a scam ring is conducting a large-scale operation.

181
00:08:13,759 --> 00:08:14,519
Their targets

182
00:08:14,519 --> 00:08:16,560
are highly likely to be incoming college freshmen.

183
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,759
Especially poor college students receiving financial aid.

184
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,959
Everyone, get to work immediately.

185
00:08:20,959 --> 00:08:22,639
To all the students who might be scammed,

186
00:08:22,639 --> 00:08:23,680
send SMS warnings.

187
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,120
Call anyone who doesn't reply directly.

188
00:08:25,199 --> 00:08:26,000
Captain Sun,

189
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,160
this is a massive workload.

190
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:28,759
And the students are too scattered.

191
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:30,519
We must persist no matter how hard it is.

192
00:08:31,279 --> 00:08:32,799
Think about the police uniform you're wearing.

193
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:34,360
No matter what,

194
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,120
we have to

195
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:35,759
protect them.

196
00:08:35,879 --> 00:08:36,840
Understood?

197
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,559
Understood!

198
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,960
Bro Long, can you go a little faster?

199
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:10,360
Okay, hold on tight.

200
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,320
Hello, I'm an officer from the Anti-Fraud Center.

201
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:15,279
We've detected that you received a scam call.

202
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,480
If they prompt you to transfer money,

203
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,360
please do not trust them.

204
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,320
They told me to transfer money.

205
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,320
Are they scammers?

206
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,200
Officer!

207
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,120
I've been scammed.

208
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,759
All my money has been transferred out.

209
00:09:23,759 --> 00:09:25,600
Don't panic. Tell me your account number right away.

210
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,799
I'll help you recover the funds.

211
00:09:26,799 --> 00:09:27,759
I was scared to death.

212
00:09:27,759 --> 00:09:29,559
That was my entire living allowance and tuition.

213
00:09:29,559 --> 00:09:30,559
They're scammers.

214
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,519
I actually thought they were from the Education Bureau.

215
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:33,799
Right, whatever you do, don't transfer any money.

216
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,639
Sir, something's not right.

217
00:09:36,639 --> 00:09:38,799
It looks like the cops are onto this deal.

218
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:47,960
Hello.

219
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,159
This is the Anti-Fraud Center.

220
00:09:49,159 --> 00:09:49,759
Zhou Hui.

221
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:51,759
How's the situation with the college students?

222
00:09:51,759 --> 00:09:53,600
Captain Sun, we've already warned a lot of people.

223
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,200
But there are still some students we can't reach.

224
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:02,919
Run a check.

225
00:10:02,919 --> 00:10:04,919
See if there's a student named Huang Shanshan.

226
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:05,399
Yes, sir.

227
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,720
Yes, she's a local.

228
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,519
A poor college student.

229
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,559
Sync the info with colleagues in other districts.

230
00:10:24,679 --> 00:10:25,879
You guys keep making calls.

231
00:10:25,879 --> 00:10:27,720
If you can't reach them, contact their parents directly.

232
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,519
Send out anti-fraud warning messages at the same time.

233
00:10:29,519 --> 00:10:30,519
The more detailed, the better.

234
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:31,559
Zhou Hui, come with me.

235
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:32,240
Yes, sir.

236
00:10:41,759 --> 00:10:43,320
It's been a whole day.

237
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,399
Stand up!

238
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:48,000
Get up!

239
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:49,840
Get in!

240
00:10:56,679 --> 00:10:57,799
One day without shaving,

241
00:10:57,799 --> 00:10:59,559
and I get an itch.

242
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,720
This feels great.

243
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:20,919
Bro Liu, I closed a deal.

244
00:11:20,919 --> 00:11:22,440
This student will transfer the money soon.

245
00:11:23,039 --> 00:11:25,240
My target is already at the ATM.

246
00:11:25,559 --> 00:11:26,879
Students are the easiest to fool.

247
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:27,879
Beautiful.

248
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:30,240
Don't let your guard down until the money's in.

249
00:11:30,519 --> 00:11:31,919
Before the cops catch on,

250
00:11:31,919 --> 00:11:32,879
keep pushing.

251
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,840
Okay, Bro Liu. Don't worry.

252
00:11:35,159 --> 00:11:36,240
You got it, Bro Liu.

253
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,759
The police have a mole.

254
00:11:46,039 --> 00:11:46,759
Immediately investigate

255
00:11:46,759 --> 00:11:48,559
everyone involved in this project.

256
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,039
Yes, sir.

257
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:53,840
Bro Liu, everyone stop.

258
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,039
Get out here.

259
00:11:55,039 --> 00:11:56,440
Bro Snake, everything's going super smoothly here.

260
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,360
Cut the crap.

261
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,320
Get out here.

262
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,159
Okay.

263
00:12:02,399 --> 00:12:03,600
It's uneven.

264
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,519
Hurry up.

265
00:12:04,519 --> 00:12:05,879
Done.

266
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:08,200
Everyone, come out and line up at the door.

267
00:12:18,759 --> 00:12:20,039
Hurry!

268
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:26,240
Everyone stop!

269
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,320
Gather outside!

270
00:12:38,919 --> 00:12:40,320
Stand still.

271
00:12:43,759 --> 00:12:44,559
Bro Snake.

272
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:47,159
Get over there too.

273
00:12:48,159 --> 00:12:49,919
Bro Snake, don't you trust me?

274
00:12:50,559 --> 00:12:51,720
Hurry up.

275
00:12:59,879 --> 00:13:00,879
Hurry up and search.

276
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:28,720
Go shave.

277
00:13:29,639 --> 00:13:31,320
Shave my ass. I'm not doing it.

278
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,519
Li Wen is definitely up to something.

279
00:13:41,279 --> 00:13:42,080
Search his desk.

280
00:13:42,080 --> 00:13:43,000
Check the trash can.
